# THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES

This file lists every direct dependency declared in the three dependency
manifests, the license of each (SPDX identifier), the native libraries bundled
inside the wheels of the PDF/image dependencies, and the full text and source
links required for the Weak_Copyleft_License (MPL-2.0) dependencies.

Manifests (all under `backend/`):

- `requirements.txt`
- `agent-runtime-requirements.txt`
- `requirements-dev.txt` (it also pulls in `requirements.txt` through `-r requirements.txt`; that file's entries are listed once, under `requirements.txt`)

SPDX identifiers were verified against the `License-Expression` / `License` /
classifier fields of the `*.dist-info/METADATA` installed in `backend/.venv`
(the exact manifest versions), plus the license files shipped in those wheels.

